% Grain→Solid promotion smoke test (Phase 17g, CGS units).
% 2D periodic box: ~64 uniform gas particles + 1 Type-3 grain above mass threshold.
% After one timestep, the grain should be promoted to a Type-0 olivine body.

% Tillotson EOS params for slot [0] (universal fallback, olivine values in CGS)
Tillotson_EOS_params_a          0.5
Tillotson_EOS_params_b          1.4
Tillotson_EOS_params_u_0        5.50e12
Tillotson_EOS_params_rho_0      3.5
Tillotson_EOS_params_A          1.31e12
Tillotson_EOS_params_B          4.90e11
Tillotson_EOS_params_u_s        4.50e10
Tillotson_EOS_params_u_s_prime  1.50e11
Tillotson_EOS_params_alpha      5.0
Tillotson_EOS_params_beta       5.0
Tillotson_EOS_params_mu         8.13e11
Tillotson_EOS_params_Y0         9.0e10

% Grain fluid parameters
Grain_Internal_Density          3.5
Grain_Size_Min                  0.01
Grain_Size_Max                  0.01
Grain_Size_Spectrum_Powerlaw    0.5

% Grain promotion thresholds
GrainPromotion_MassThresh_cgs   0.01
GrainPromotion_DustGasRatioThresh  0.0

InitCondFile                    grain_promotion_ics
OutputDir                       output
SnapshotFileBase                snapshot

TimeMax                         1.0e-5
TimeBetSnapshot                 5.0e-6
TimeBegin                       0.0
OutputListOn                    0
BoxSize                         10.0

MaxSizeTimestep                 1.0e-6
MinSizeTimestep                 1.0e-12
CourantFac                      0.2
ErrTolIntAccuracy               0.01
MaxRMSDisplacementFac           0.25

DesNumNgb                       16
MaxNumNgbDeviation              1
PartAllocFactor                 50

ErrTolForceAcc                  0.001
ErrTolTheta                     0.7

TimeBetStatistics               5.0e-6
MaxMemSize                      500

ResubmitOn                      0
ResubmitCommand                 none

UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s        1.0
UnitLength_in_cm                1.0
UnitMass_in_g                   1.0
